{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Azmar Quest is a text-based RPG, with turn-based battles and old-school vibes. The single-player main story should last at least <strong>20</strong> hours, then there's a lot of additional content! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Single-Player Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Turn-Based Battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf  PvP battles (1v1 and 2v2) and co-op Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/extras/steam-screenshot-vayne-talk.png?t=1745478470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Choose 1 of the 4 hero classes available: <strong>Warrior</strong>, <strong>Cleric</strong>, <strong>Witch</strong> or <strong>Archer</strong>, each with their own strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf <strong>24</strong> unique skills per class, 4 armor slots and 4 potion slots to create your build and enhance your Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Follow Azmar's story in a text-based RPG adventure, make choices that matter with multiple endings, fight 100+ unique enemies in turn-based battles, and reach level 30!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The single player story should last at least <strong>20</strong>\u00a0hours.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/extras/steam-screenshot-vayne-fight.png?t=1745478470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Does the game have anything else to offer? Of course it does!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Face new single-player quests and challenges every day, fight in the 2v2 Arena with your companion, or fight in 3v3 party-based battles in the Veiled Realm, and reach Mastery 100!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Play online in Dungeons, 1v1 or 2v2 battles, or play rated battles, and reach rank 1000 in PvP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Developer Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf<i> </i>The game is completely accessible for visually impaired users too, using any screen reader like NVDA. It has a separate accessible interface when you enable accessibility in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf The game is only in english. It's very unlikely that I will have time to translate it, but you never know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf This is a <strong>one-person</strong> project. I'm constantly developing and improving it. It just takes a lot of time, have patience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474140?t=1745478470","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745478470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/19cb9eb67da1a82a59242c28738ebe8b5758d940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745478470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/19cb9eb67da1a82a59242c28738ebe8b5758d940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745478470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3535620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Azmar Quest is a text-based RPG, with turn-based battles and old-school vibes. The single-player main story should last at least <strong>20</strong> hours, then there's a lot of additional content! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Single-Player Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Turn-Based Battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf  PvP battles (1v1 and 2v2) and co-op Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/extras/steam-screenshot-vayne-talk.png?t=1745478470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Choose 1 of the 4 hero classes available: <strong>Warrior</strong>, <strong>Cleric</strong>, <strong>Witch</strong> or <strong>Archer</strong>, each with their own strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf <strong>24</strong> unique skills per class, 4 armor slots and 4 potion slots to create your build and enhance your Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Follow Azmar's story in a text-based RPG adventure, make choices that matter with multiple endings, fight 100+ unique enemies in turn-based battles, and reach level 30!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The single player story should last at least <strong>20</strong>\u00a0hours.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/extras/steam-screenshot-vayne-fight.png?t=1745478470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Does the game have anything else to offer? Of course it does!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Face new single-player quests and challenges every day, fight in the 2v2 Arena with your companion, or fight in 3v3 party-based battles in the Veiled Realm, and reach Mastery 100!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Play online in Dungeons, 1v1 or 2v2 battles, or play rated battles, and reach rank 1000 in PvP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Developer Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf<i> </i>The game is completely accessible for visually impaired users too, using any screen reader like NVDA. It has a separate accessible interface when you enable accessibility in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf The game is only in english. It's very unlikely that I will have time to translate it, but you never know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf This is a <strong>one-person</strong> project. I'm constantly developing and improving it. It just takes a lot of time, have patience.</p>","developers":["Sevan Soukiassian"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Google Firebase ","genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474140/header.jpg?t=1745478470","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100487,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100487/movie480.mp4?t=1740066759","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100487/movie_max.mp4?t=1740066759"},"name":"Azmar Quest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100487/9220b83adabd2e087fb0cb1d7c2ee329e238716f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740066759","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100487/movie480_vp9